          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.3.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilg 3.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Enkaraki e ina paa enkirukoto eitasheyie peyie aa empiris eigarakino ina kisiligata, neitadedeyieki te ishoi enye pooki, neme te lelo asujak loo nkitanapat aa ninche ake, kake o te lelo oong'arie Abraham enkirukoto, amu ninye menye iyiook pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 17.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Anaa enatisiraki aajo, “Aaitaa nanu iyie menye loo loreren kumok.” Te dukuya Enkai etang'amua ninye ina kisiligata, ina Ai nairuko ninye, naa ninye naisho ilootuata enkishui, neipotu intokin nemeetae neaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.15.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 15.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " To siligi eiruko neisilig melioo entoki naisiligu pee etum ataa menye loo loreren kumok; anaa enapa natiaakaki eji, “Inji ebayu eishoi ino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 17.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eitu eshalu enkirukoto enye pee eing'or osesen lenye makewan, ototiwuo anaa olotua amu etinyikaka ilarin iip te moruao enye, aashu pee eing'or enguset e Sara ajo olupi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meetae olng'ash oidima aigusugusie enkisiligata naisiliga Enkai kake etagolo ninye te ina kirukoto anaa pee eishoo Enkai enkitoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etonyorrayie tukul inchere keidim Enkai aitabai ina naisiligie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina pee eikenakaki enkirukoto enye nchere esupatisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ilo rorei ojo “Eikenakaki”, mme enkaraki ninye ake pee etisiraki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake enkaraki sii ninche iyiook ilooiruk ilo oitopiwuo Yesu Kristo Olaitoriani lang too lootuata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.53.4+ISA.53.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
